# USB settings is GLO's third page; it is status-only until USB host audio is implemented.
# Existing page IDs and controls remain unchanged.
notips
tap GLO
expect view 11
tap GLO
expect view 12
tap GLO
expect view 17
wait 300
shot usb.png
# Returning from another page recalls USB, and cycling wraps to Setup 1.
tap HOME
expect view 0
tap GLO
expect view 17
tap GLO
expect view 11
tap GLO
expect view 12
tap GLO
expect view 17
# Swell retains its original page number and GLO cannot steal that page.
tap ARP
expect view 13
tap HOME
expect view 0
